{"n":14,"title":"Always? Sometimes? Never.","blurb":"By the end you can say how often you do things — always / usually / sometimes / never — and ask Do you…? / How often…?","steps":[{"stage":"Warm-up","type":"pick","title":"Quick recall from Lesson 13. Choose, then check.","sub":"Здесь нет правильного ответа","options":[{"label":"gets"},{"label":"get"},{"label":"geted"},{"label":"goes"},{"label":"go"},{"label":"gos"},{"label":"have"},{"label":"has"},{"label":"is"},{"label":"works"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"cards","title":"Слова урока","sub":"Нажми на карточку, чтобы увидеть перевод","words":[{"en":"Always","pos":"","ru":"всегда","kk":"әрқашан","def":"every time; 100%","img":"/course/a0/img/l14-always.jpg","audio":"/learning/audio/a0/6656018ac96d.mp3"},{"en":"Usually, often","pos":"","ru":"обычно, часто","kk":"әдетте, жиі","def":"almost every time; many times","img":"/course/a0/img/l14-usually-often.jpg","audio":"/learning/audio/a0/add56c6f3181.mp3"},{"en":"Sometimes","pos":"","ru":"иногда","kk":"кейде","def":"on some days yes, on some days no","img":"/course/a0/img/l14-sometimes.jpg","audio":"/learning/audio/a0/297f31f02b99.mp3"},{"en":"Every day","pos":"","ru":"каждый день","kk":"күн сайын","def":"on all seven days of the week","img":"/course/a0/img/l14-every-day.jpg","audio":"/learning/audio/a0/a3fd743ac147.mp3"},{"en":"Never","pos":"","ru":"никогда","kk":"ешқашан","def":"at no time; 0%","img":"/course/a0/img/l14-never.jpg","audio":"/learning/audio/a0/85777c03b725.mp3"},{"en":"Once / twice a week","pos":"","ru":"раз / два раза в неделю","kk":"аптасына бір / екі рет","def":"one time or two times in a week","img":"/course/a0/img/l14-once-twice-a-week.jpg","audio":"/learning/audio/a0/dd7430607ba3.mp3"},{"en":"How often…?","pos":"","ru":"Как часто…?","kk":"Қаншалықты жиі…?","def":"the question about frequency","img":"/course/a0/img/l14-how-often.jpg","audio":"/learning/audio/a0/c1d90cf02b98.mp3"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"choice","title":"Выбери правильны