ats meat. (0%)","options":["never","always","rarely"],"answer":"never"},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Choose the correct word.","prompt":"“How often do you exercise?” →","options":["Twice a week.","It&#x27;s Monday.","always"],"answer":"Twice a week."},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Choose the correct word.","prompt":"“Do you like tea?” →","options":["No, I don&#x27;t.","No, there isn&#x27;t.","Twice a week."],"answer":"No, I don&#x27;t."},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Choose the correct word.","prompt":"She ___ eat meat. (–)","options":["doesn&#x27;t","don&#x27;t","didn&#x27;t"],"answer":"doesn&#x27;t"},{"stage":"Listening","type":"rows","title":"Listen. Then choose True or False.","sub":"","track":"a0_4bb97e43d7.mp3","items":[{"q":"The tagelmust is a piece of cloth.","options":["True","False"],"answer":"True"},{"q":"Women wear the tagelmust.","options":["True","False"],"answer":"False"},{"q":"It is often blue.","options":["True","False"],"answer":"True"}]},{"stage":"Speaking","type":"write","title":"Work with your teacher. Ask and answer: Do you…? How often do you…? Use always/usually/sometimes/never.","sub":"Напиши ответ, затем проверь себя","placeholder":"Твой ответ…","model":"Did you use a frequency adverb (always, usually, never)?"},{"stage":"Wrap","type":"checklist","title":"Отметь, чему научился","sub":"Я могу…","items":["✓ say how often (always / usually / sometimes / never)","✓ make negatives (I don&#x27;t / she doesn&#x27;t)","✓ ask questions (Do you…? / Does he…?)","✓ ask How often…?","always 🔊 всегда · әрқашан + Add to My Dictionary","usually 🔊 обычно · әдетте + Add to My Dictionary"]}]}